      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean yeah i know not to double it but it’s really messing with me. if i take it right before bed instead of in the morning does that make it better? i feel like if the dose hits while im sleeping i wont notice the dizziness as much. also is there like a certain amount i can take with something else so it doesn't feel so weird? like if i took some extra lisinopril just once to stabilize it?",
